*Figure: Generation-by-generation best fitness for 4 representative seeds. MalthusJAX variants and Evosax DE show smooth convergence; SimpleGA plateaus earlier and shows additional noise.*

**Execution Time Distribution**
![Sphere 10D Timing](figures/sphere_dim10_timing_boxplot.png)
*Figure: Runtime distribution across 100 seeds per pipeline. Box shows quartiles; whiskers show min/max (excluding outliers). Similar distributions across frameworks confirm parity in computational load.*

**Robustness Distribution (100 Seeds)**
![Sphere 10D Final Fitness](figures/sphere_dim10_final_best_fitness_boxplot.png)
