## 3. Performance & Timing Analysis

### 3.1 Execution Time Distribution

Across all four benchmark landscapes, execution times per run (single seed, 500 generations) remained consistent, demonstrating stable performance characteristics for all five pipelines. This section analyzes timing distributions to assess computational efficiency and identify any algorithmic or framework-level overhead patterns.

#### Timing Statistics Across All Experiments

| Landscape | Pipeline | Median (s) | Q1 (s) | Q3 (s) | IQR (s) |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Sphere 10D** | malthusjax_default | 52.02 | 51.03 | 53.10 | 2.07 |
